        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: First Satanic Church\n- People: Karla LaVey, Anton LaVey\n- Places: San Francisco, California\n- Concepts: LaVeyan Satanism, The Satanic Bible\n\nFacts:\n- Anton LaVey, born Howard Stanton Levey, was born on April 11, 1930, and died on October 31, 1997.\n- Anton LaVey was an American author, musician, and occultist.\n- The First Satanic Church was founded by Karla LaVey on October 31, 1999, in San Francisco, California.\n- The First Satanic Church is dedicated to LaVeyan Satanism as codified by Anton LaVey in The Satanic Bible.",
